From: LM-G820N Developer <dev@lmg820n.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] qcom: add flash device control and precapture measurement

Add sysfs FlashDevice controller managing white and yellow flash LEDs on
PM8150L PMIC. Implement Chromatix-aligned flash measurement sequence with
enter frame skip, torch settling convergence, flux ratio extrapolation,
and strobe trigger on still capture. Expose draft FlashMode and FlashState
controls and map Android HAL flash modes and precapture triggers.

---
